            <ArticleTitle>Topical Human Placental Extract For the Treatment of Vitiligo.</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>199-201</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>Fifty percent human placental hydroalcoholic extract was used topically on 34 vitiligo patients. Complete clearing of lesions was seen in 20.6% cases, whereas 50% cases showed mild to moderate improvement, and 29.4% showed no response. No serious side effects were seen in any of the patients.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
